  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Horti Demo Facility Grootvlei</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To be able to establish a Horti Demo Facility (HDF) and to create alternative jobs and business opportunities and healthy food for the local communities of the Grootvlei coal-fired powerplant, development of a business case for a South-African and Dutch consortium, coordination and tailormade advise to pave the way for the implementation of facility are needed.The implementation of the HDF is an important step in the further Development of the Grootvlei combi-track, including the development of a future agro-hub in the area.</narrative>
  </description>
